# Used with: scripts/e2e.sh tests/e2e/viewer.actions -- target/debug/temzdf standalone pdf --clean target/fixtures/sample.pdf
# Judged (expect, mouse input replayed with its timing): start (page 1, fit
# width), after a flick of the wheel, zoomed in at the pointer with sharp text
# once tiles arrive, panned by a drag in the left margin (a drag over text
# selects instead), and page 3 after `3G`. zoom-early (not judged: the replay
# has its tiles at once) shows the old tiles scaled right after zooming.
pause 1
expect start
wheel 5
pause 1
expect wheel5
wheel -3 300 200 C
pause 0.05
shot zoom-early
pause 1.5
expect zoom
drag 30 400 250
pause 0.5
expect drag
keys 3 shift+g
pause 1.5
expect page3
